<!id: stringbuffer-to-stringbuilder>
<!description: Review StringBuffer usage before considering StringBuilder>
<!severity: info>
<!tags: performance, modernization>

"Review StringBuffer type, uses, and thread sharing":
new java.lang.StringBuffer() :: isAssignedToLocalVariable()
;;

"Review StringBuffer type, uses, and thread sharing":
new java.lang.StringBuffer($arg) :: isAssignedToLocalVariable()
;;
